# SPA fallback used to live here as `/* /index.html 200`.
# Cloudflare Pages (Advanced Mode / _worker.js) treats that as an infinite loop and
# ignores it — see deploy logs: "Infinite loop detected in this rule".
#
# SPA routing is handled by:
#   - dist/404.html (= index.html) for Connect-to-Git / asset 404s
#   - [assets] not_found_handling = "single-page-application" in wrangler.toml (CLI deploy)
# /api/* stays on Pages Functions via _routes.json + _worker.js.
